{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Where Speed Meets Chaos</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>Get ready to experience slot racing like never before. <strong>Speed Rivals</strong> combines precision, strategy, and adrenaline in every twist and turn. Master impossible tracks, customize every inch of your ride, and prove who rules the leaderboards and tournaments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389390/extras/f9be008d4b4310c107d0768c6959c60c.avif?t=1773775006\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389390/extras_big/f9be008d4b4310c107d0768c6959c60c.avif?t=1773775006 width=800 height=293 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389390/extras/eb559cc475d536785a17656b8748b07f.avif?t=1773775006\" width=768 height=140 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the <strong>track editor</strong> to design legendary circuits exactly how you want them. Upload your creations, challenge the community to beat your times, or discover new tracks from other players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389390/extras/487eeccbb812c6dc2fb7990177f7427b.poster.avif?t=1773775006\" width=1170 height=426 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389390/extras/487eeccbb812c6dc2fb7990177f7427b.webm?t=1773775006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389390/extras/487eeccbb812c6dc2fb7990177f7427b.mp4?t=1773775006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389390/extras/6b13e914f84c30bcd1db8d931b2bbc41.avif?t=1773775006\" width=768 height=140 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect and unlock over <strong>100 unique cars</strong> \u2014 from timeless classics to futuristic beasts. Repaint, add decals, slap on logos \u2014 make it yours. More cars and updates will keep coming based on community feedback.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389390/extras/32c4d35c0b06f3b9a65cdd7754af60df.poster.avif?t=1773775006\" width=766 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389390/extras/32c4d35c0b06f3b9a65cdd7754af60df.webm?t=1773775006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389390/extras/32c4d35c0b06f3b9a65cdd7754af60df.mp4?t=1773775006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389390/extras/4bc38f42ef4a8f13a70980bad41b1949.avif?t=1773775006\" width=768 height=140 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to pick up, tough to master. Hit the gas, stay on the rail, and avoid derailing at all costs. Every corner pushes your reflexes and tactics to the edge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389390/extras/8d10bf565f71a14c30ed18bc39f19b5d.poster.avif?t=1773775006\" width=766 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389390/extras/8d10bf565f71a14c30ed18bc39f19b5d.webm?t=1773775006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389390/extras/8d10bf565f71a14c30ed18bc39f19b5d.mp4?t=1773775006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389390/extras/316a8ea1727f3a9a45f86457bca7a6ae.avif?t=1773775006\" width=768 height=140 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb the championship ranks and prove your skills race after race. Unlock new cars, tracks, and customization options by tackling tougher and tougher challenges. Rise up the <strong>leaderboards</strong>, win tournaments, and complete achievements to unlock everything <strong>Speed Rivals</strong> has to offer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389390/extras/39129fdd940d2721d6283fe11e61a443.poster.avif?t=1773775006\" width=766 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389390/extras/39129fdd940d2721d6283fe11e61a443.webm?t=1773775006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389390/extras/39129fdd940d2721d6283fe11e61a443.mp4?t=1773775006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389390/extras/fa24442e9a3059e5b0c9f4c0180d7083.avif?t=1773775006\" width=768 height=140 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Practice without pressure and master every corner at your own pace. No time limit, no rivals \u2014 just you and the track.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389390/extras/e642b397cb8c2511e2e93a404906d89c.poster.avif?t=1773775006\" width=766 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389390/extras/e642b397cb8c2511e2e93a404906d89c.webm?t=1773775006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389390/extras/e642b397cb8c2511e2e93a404906d89c.mp4?t=1773775006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leave your mark on every track. Master the rail, design impossible challenges, battle in tournaments, and take on your friends. With constant updates and an active community, <strong>Speed Rivals</strong> is waiting for you. Ready to hit the track?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389390/extras/9221c2649572d7f15b61f8316433cb2c.avif?t=1773775006\" width=768 height=140 /></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Crash with style","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3389390/318e6052608d0c02c17b521b03269023aa223164.jpg"},{"name":"No Limits","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3389390/37da0632bd8a048c0275539c0d808869fa19db68.jpg"},{"name":"Long Crash","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3389390/b834ee4323a537b11d5b2d1f5d28c366d803f42a.jpg"},{"name":"On the Right Track","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3389390/3889d5794de44656a52a81825dd0fc1467da05a9.jpg"},{"name":"Track King","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3389390/5fd98a726b5d907875c40f6d6f7764390d8572ec.jpg"},{"name":"World Slotminator","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3389390/bdc040476e705215c7b453464d04c898dc99765a.jpg"}],"total":6},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3389390?t=1773775006","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389390/eee25cfc001c3a4316e3d32d64b8f31bec66992b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773775006","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389390/bb1de458778619a7b1bec451732b4ea14afe779b/capsule_231x87_alt_assets_2.jpg?t=1773775006","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389390/bb1de458778619a7b1bec451732b4ea14afe779b/capsule_184x69_alt_assets_2.jpg?t=1773775006","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":51},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Where Speed Meets Chaos</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>Get ready to experience slot racing like never before. <strong>Speed Rivals</strong> combines precision, strategy, and adrenaline in every twist and turn. Master impossible tracks, customize every inch of your ride, and prove who rules the leaderboards and tournaments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389390/extras/f9be008d4b4310c107d0768c6959c60c.avif?t=1773775006\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389390/extras_big/f9be008d4b4310c107d0768c6959c60c.avif?t=1773775006 width=800 height=293 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389390/extras/eb559cc475d536785a17656b8748b07f.avif?t=1773775006\" width=768 height=140 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the <strong>track editor</strong> to design legendary circuits exactly how you want them. Upload your creations, challenge the community to beat your times, or discover new tracks from other players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389390/extras/487eeccbb812c6dc2fb7990177f7427b.poster.avif?t=1773775006\" width=1170 height=426 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389390/extras/487eeccbb812c6dc2fb7990177f7427b.webm?t=1773775006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389390/extras/487eeccbb812c6dc2fb7990177f7427b.mp4?t=1773775006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389390/extras/6b13e914f84c30bcd1db8d931b2bbc41.avif?t=1773775006\" width=768 height=140 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect and unlock over <strong>100 unique cars</strong> \u2014 from timeless classics to futuristic beasts. Repaint, add decals, slap on logos \u2014 make it yours. More cars and updates will keep coming based on community feedback.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389390/extras/32c4d35c0b06f3b9a65cdd7754af60df.poster.avif?t=1773775006\" width=766 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389390/extras/32c4d35c0b06f3b9a65cdd7754af60df.webm?t=1773775006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389390/extras/32c4d35c0b06f3b9a65cdd7754af60df.mp4?t=1773775006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389390/extras/4bc38f42ef4a8f13a70980bad41b1949.avif?t=1773775006\" width=768 height=140 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy to pick up, tough to master. Hit the gas, stay on the rail, and avoid derailing at all costs. Every corner pushes your reflexes and tactics to the edge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389390/extras/8d10bf565f71a14c30ed18bc39f19b5d.poster.avif?t=1773775006\" width=766 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389390/extras/8d10bf565f71a14c30ed18bc39f19b5d.webm?t=1773775006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389390/extras/8d10bf565f71a14c30ed18bc39f19b5d.mp4?t=1773775006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389390/extras/316a8ea1727f3a9a45f86457bca7a6ae.avif?t=1773775006\" width=768 height=140 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb the championship ranks and prove your skills race after race. Unlock new cars, tracks, and customization options by tackling tougher and tougher challenges. Rise up the <strong>leaderboards</strong>, win tournaments, and complete achievements to unlock everything <strong>Speed Rivals</strong> has to offer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389390/extras/39129fdd940d2721d6283fe11e61a443.poster.avif?t=1773775006\" width=766 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389390/extras/39129fdd940d2721d6283fe11e61a443.webm?t=1773775006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389390/extras/39129fdd940d2721d6283fe11e61a443.mp4?t=1773775006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389390/extras/fa24442e9a3059e5b0c9f4c0180d7083.avif?t=1773775006\" width=768 height=140 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Practice without pressure and master every corner at your own pace. No time limit, no rivals \u2014 just you and the track.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3389390/extras/e642b397cb8c2511e2e93a404906d89c.poster.avif?t=1773775006\" width=766 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/stor